{"id":"00193","root":"uni00193_1","name":{"ja":"ユノー","en":"Yuno"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ユノー","en":"Yuno"},"aliases":["Juno the Android"],"element":"Spiritual","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-05-17","limited":false,"characterId":152,"profile":{"ja":"政府の外郭組織のとある研究所で開発された、日本初のアンドロイド・プロトタイプ。実際は脳と臓器の一部など全体の２０％には生体が使われており、正確にはアンドロイドに近いサイボーグと言える。五次元理論に基づき異次元世界へのアストラル干渉をまとめた通称・益田理論によって開発されたアストラル・コアを動力源とする。両手足に内蔵されているアストラル・コンデンサより「アストラル・ライトニング」というエネルギー攻撃を発し、魔族をも屠る。さらにこれを応用し、短時間の飛行も可能。実働部隊において実戦運用され、対魔族戦で数々の実績をあげている。アンドロイド開発とアストラル・コアのさらなる研究のためには莫大な予算が必要で、ユノーはそのためのデモンストレーションマシンでもある。ユノーの生体部分には、開発者である益田博士の亡くなった娘・由利子のものが使われており、容姿も由利子に似せて作られている。","en":"(Yuno, she/her) She is the first Japanese prototype android developed at a government-affiliated research lab. In reality, about twenty percent of her composition—such as portions of her brain and organs—is biological, making her more accurately a cyborg. Powered by an Astral Core created through the so-called Masuda Theory, which integrates five-dimensional principles to achieve astral interference with other dimensions, she can unleash \"Astral Lightning\" from condensers embedded in her limbs, a energy attack capable of slaying demons. She can also adapt this ability for short-range flight. Actively deployed in combat units, she has earned numerous accolades in battles against demons. Massive funding is required for further android development and Astral Core research, and Yuno herself serves as a demonstration machine for that purpose. The biological components within her were taken from Dr. Masuda's deceased daughter, Yuriko, and her appearance was modeled after Yuriko."},"illustrator":"おぶい","voiceActor":"木多野あり","forms":[{"id":"uni00193_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[764,1528],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[119,238],"def":[91,182],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","190009"]},{"id":"uni00193_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60